---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import {site} from '../data/site';
---
<Base>
<section class="hero wrap">
 <div class="hero-copy"><p class="intro"><span class="status-dot"></span> Health records. Billing. Connected.</p><h1 class="hero-title"><span class="line">Your health has</span><span class="line">a story.</span><span class="line last">See the thread.</span></h1><p class="lede">A lab result here. A bill over there. Medscan brings the pieces into context, so your next question has somewhere to start.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={site.app}>Explore the demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#how">Follow the connection <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><p class="demo-note">A working proof of concept, using synthetic data only.</p></div>
 <figure class="story" aria-label="Illustration of health and billing records connected to a QR report">
 <div class="story-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div><svg class="threads" viewBox="0 0 600 600" aria-hidden="true"><path class="thread-path" d="M160 90V195Q160 225 210 225H420Q455 225 455 270V380Q455 415 410 415H250Q220 415 220 465V540"/><circle class="connect-dot" cx="455" cy="310" r="7"/></svg>
 <div class="record-sheet lab"><div class="sheet-top"><span class="sheet-icon">✚</span><span>Health record</span></div><strong>Every result,<br/>with its context.</strong><div class="mini-chart" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="sheet-meta">Lab results · Visits · Diagnoses</span></div>
 <div class="record-sheet bill"><div class="sheet-top"><span class="sheet-icon">≡</span><span>Billing record</span></div><strong>The visit.<br/>The bill. The link.</strong><div class="receipt-lines" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="sheet-meta">Bills · Payments · Balances</span></div>
 <div class="record-sheet connected"><span class="connection-mark" aria-hidden="true">↳</span><div><span class="sheet-meta">One connected report</span><strong>A place to ask why.</strong></div><div class="qr-art" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><figcaption>From scattered records to a connected conversation.<br/>Concept illustration, not a patient record.</figcaption>
 </figure>
</section>
<div class="scope-strip"><div class="wrap"><span>Built around the questions that come next.</span><span>Medical terms</span><span>Visit history</span><span>Billing context</span></div></div>
<section class="how wrap" id="how"><div class="section-heading" data-reveal><p class="section-label">From paper to perspective</p><h2>One report.<br/>A better starting point.</h2><p>Start with a report, or start with a question. Both lead to the same simple conversation.</p></div><div class="steps"><article data-reveal><span class="step-num">01</span><div><h3>Open the connection.</h3><p>Scan the QR on a Medscan report or enter its report code. The conversation opens with a summary of that saved report.</p></div><span class="step-symbol" aria-hidden="true">⌗</span></article><article data-reveal><span class="step-num">02</span><div><h3>Put a term in context.</h3><p>Ask about medical or billing language. General explanations come from curated knowledge with links to reviewed sources.</p></div><span class="step-symbol" aria-hidden="true">?</span></article><article data-reveal><span class="step-num">03</span><div><h3>Follow up on the details.</h3><p>With sign-in and patient permission, explore current visits, results, bills and payments inside the same conversation.</p></div><span class="step-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↳</span></article></div></section>
<section class="connection-section"><div class="wrap connection-layout"><div data-reveal><p class="section-label">The whole picture has more than one source.</p><h2>A result is one fact.<br/>The connection<br/>is the next question.</h2><a class="text-link light-link" href="/about/">Look inside the project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="question-list"><p>What does LDL mean?<span>Curated explanation + sources</span></p><p>How many visits this year?<span>Authorized current records</span></p><p>Which visit does this bill belong to?<span>Health + billing context</span></p><p>What changed since this report?<span>Saved snapshot alongside current records</span></p></div></div></section>
<section class="honesty wrap"><h2 data-reveal>Clear about the records.<br/>Clear about the limits.</h2><div class="honesty-copy" data-reveal><p>Medscan is an engineering proof of concept. The demo uses generated and synthetic health data, never real patient records.</p><p>Answers cover supported questions and curated topics. Private information requires identity and patient access. A saved report is a snapshot; current records can differ.</p><a class="text-link" href={site.source}>Explore the project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
<section class="final-cta wrap" data-reveal><p>Less searching between systems.</p><h2>More room for<br/>the next question.</h2><a class="button" href={site.app}>Try Medscan <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="cta-note">Synthetic demo · No real patient data</span></section>
</Base>
